{"version":1,"content":"<p>衞生署連日採取突擊行動，搜查尖沙嘴、旺角、荃灣和元朗4間提供美容服務的處所，其中在兩個處所檢獲超過100支懷疑第一部毒藥針劑以及超過70支懷疑未經註冊的藥劑製品針劑，包括一款名為Elravie Re2O（俗稱「屍皮針」）的產品，一名38歲女子被捕。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T16:01:33.126698+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":124,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T15:20:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T08:17:41.748621+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T15:58:08.716327+00:00","content_hash":"84ebc6a0da025b207f9a48d0e470ba48fa2b9c64191bc0f8fa7ebffe14c85b0b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}